  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Higher Education Rock and Tunnel Engineering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall aim of this project is capacity strengthening within rock and tunnel engineering in Nepal through capacity development for staff through PhD research and training, establishment of tunnel engineering laboratory, teaching and supervision, and student exchange.</narrative>
